1
00:01:08,530 --> 00:01:13,000
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,090 --> 00:01:15,990
[Episode 5]

3
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:23,789
Director Xu,

4
00:01:24,130 --> 00:01:25,150
this is for you.

5
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:42,560
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

6
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,150
Since you're recommending me

7
00:01:44,150 --> 00:01:45,680
for a role in your next TV series,
Director Xu,

8
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:47,410
I have to show my appreciation.

9
00:01:47,509 --> 00:01:48,770
Oh, you didn't have to.

10
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,350
By the way,

11
00:01:50,350 --> 00:01:52,430
Mr. Pei said he couldn't find the place,

12
00:01:52,430 --> 00:01:53,500
so I'll go meet him.

13
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:55,840
Just order whatever you'd like to eat.

14
00:02:08,070 --> 00:02:08,669
[Restroom]

15
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:40,600
[Restroom]

16
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,290
Director Xu, are you all right?

17
00:03:03,820 --> 00:03:04,840
I had no idea

18
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:07,640
you had a habit
of going into the women's restroom.

19
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:11,320
I was worried you might feel unwell
or something might happen to you.

20
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,110
Your showing up is the problem.

21
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,940
[Restroom]

22
00:03:20,310 --> 00:03:21,370
What are you doing?

23
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:26,520
I'm a public figure, after all.

24
00:03:26,540 --> 00:03:28,740
What if someone takes a picture of me...

25
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:32,890
You're this close to me right now.

26
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:35,960
Aren't you afraid I'll expose you one day?

27
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,420
If I can go down with you, Director Xu,

28
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,370
it'll be an honor of a lifetime.

29
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:47,560
What's so funny?

30
00:03:49,490 --> 00:03:50,960
You're breathing on my neck.

31
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:51,940
It's ticklish.

32
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,000
Besides,

33
00:03:54,310 --> 00:03:55,760
your face is all red.

34
00:03:58,870 --> 00:04:00,600
With someone as gorgeous as you

35
00:04:01,150 --> 00:04:02,120
so close to me,

36
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,300
blushing is only natural.

37
00:04:05,930 --> 00:04:08,400
Weren't you going to get Mr. Pei?

38
00:04:08,570 --> 00:04:09,670
He's already here.

39
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,880
Everyone's waiting for you.

40
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:14,980
We should go.

41
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,610
Don't keep them waiting.

42
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:22,750
Director Xu, if you ever run into
any trouble, you can always come to me.

43
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:25,450
I'm very good
at handling unexpected situations.

44
00:04:25,450 --> 00:04:27,300
Are you offering your services?

45
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,100
You could say that.

46
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,240
But I don't come cheap.

47
00:04:38,510 --> 00:04:39,680
What's your rate?

48
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:42,110
Just one meal.

49
00:04:42,830 --> 00:04:43,890
A one-on-one meal.

50
00:04:46,310 --> 00:04:48,970
Zhao Xiao,
you're certainly straightforward.

51
00:04:49,510 --> 00:04:52,240
I'm always straightforward
with someone I like.

52
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,870
Our brilliant Director Xu

53
00:05:05,910 --> 00:05:07,270
certainly has an excellent eye for talent.

54
00:05:07,270 --> 00:05:08,740
This is Zhao Xiao, right?

55
00:05:08,830 --> 00:05:09,440
Yes.

56
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:12,240
He's got real star quality.

57
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:15,430
I'm terribly sorry
to keep you both waiting.

58
00:05:15,430 --> 00:05:16,630
I was a bit late.

59
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:17,920
I got held up chatting

60
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:20,160
with the chairman
of Huaying Group just now.

61
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:23,830
He said that, given the state
of the film and TV industry these days,

62
00:05:23,830 --> 00:05:26,560
staying busy is better
than having nothing to do.

63
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:27,800
Absolutely.

64
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:28,720
Mr. Pei,

65
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,750
allow me to propose a toast.

66
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,150
I'll drink tea instead of alcohol.

67
00:05:32,150 --> 00:05:33,120
I hope you don't mind.

68
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,480
Come on, let's have a drink.

69
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:36,740
Thank you for making time for us, Mr. Pei.

70
00:05:39,610 --> 00:05:41,290
When Xu Jing invites me,

71
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,890
I'd turn down anyone else's gathering

72
00:05:42,890 --> 00:05:44,500
to be here.

73
00:05:44,670 --> 00:05:45,830
But Xu Jing,

74
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,310
you have to promise me one thing today.

75
00:05:47,310 --> 00:05:49,090
You must let me handle

76
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:51,040
your upcoming TV series project.

77
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,340
I've heard

78
00:05:53,870 --> 00:05:56,590
Mr. Yin has his eye on it, too.

79
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,560
You can't let me down.

80
00:05:58,830 --> 00:05:59,810
Of course not.

81
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,560
Do you know Mr. Yin?

82
00:06:03,690 --> 00:06:05,290
I'll introduce you sometime.

83
00:06:05,290 --> 00:06:08,420
I hear he's vacationing
in the south of France right now.

84
00:06:08,730 --> 00:06:09,860
Unlike Mr. Yin,

85
00:06:09,950 --> 00:06:12,290
I have to take care of everything myself.

86
00:06:12,390 --> 00:06:14,120
I guess I'm just a born worrier.

87
00:06:14,510 --> 00:06:16,360
You mean Mr. Yin of Yin Entertainment?

88
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,560
I've heard so much about him.

89
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,480
He practically owns
half the entertainment industry.

90
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,130
Mr. Pei,

91
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:21,390
don't worry.

92
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,500
Uncle Yin did tell me a few days ago

93
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,510
that he was interested
in investing in this project.

94
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:27,510
But he wants to use someone named...

95
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:28,870
Zhang Yufan.

96
00:06:29,270 --> 00:06:31,000
But let me make one thing clear.

97
00:06:31,380 --> 00:06:33,040
I brought Zhao Xiao here today

98
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:36,140
because I want Zhao Xiao
to be my leading man.

99
00:06:41,190 --> 00:06:41,950
Hello, Mr. Zhao.

100
00:06:41,950 --> 00:06:43,530
I'm a big fan of your work.

101
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:46,270
-Let me raise a glass to you.
-Of course I trust your judgment.

102
00:06:46,270 --> 00:06:48,190
But this is your first
major TV series, after all.

103
00:06:48,190 --> 00:06:51,120
It'd be safer to cast
some big-name stars with a huge following.

104
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:53,270
I've invested money in this project,

105
00:06:53,510 --> 00:06:54,600
so I need to see

106
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,240
a return on my investment, don't I?

107
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,420
Yes, absolutely.

108
00:06:57,830 --> 00:06:58,840
But don't worry.

109
00:06:58,380 --> 00:07:00,340
[Yin Liming is vacationing
in the south of France with his family.]

110
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,420
I have some good news.

111
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:02,390
Ms. Du Chunqing

112
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:04,820
has already agreed
to play the female lead.

113
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,970
You got her on board that quickly?

114
00:07:06,970 --> 00:07:08,300
Excellent, excellent.

115
00:07:09,430 --> 00:07:11,240
Then it's settled.
Zhao Xiao will be our male lead.

116
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,430
Thank you, Mr. Pei.

117
00:07:12,460 --> 00:07:15,120
It's an honor to have Mr. Pei's approval

118
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,120
and Director Xu's confidence in me.

119
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:16,950
Let me raise a glass to you.

120
00:07:16,950 --> 00:07:19,250
Who says actors are all so aloof?

121
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:20,720
You're quite the sophisticated one.

122
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:21,850
Come on, bottoms up!

123
00:07:24,870 --> 00:07:26,270
It's such a happy occasion.

124
00:07:26,270 --> 00:07:28,560
You have to have a drink.

125
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:30,030
Mr. Pei...

126
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:30,680
Come on.

127
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,870
You have to drink.

128
00:07:31,870 --> 00:07:32,800
Mr. Pei, I'll drink with you.

129
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:33,270
Come on.

130
00:07:34,220 --> 00:07:34,990
Come on.

131
00:07:35,090 --> 00:07:37,090
Our future superstar, have a drink.

132
00:08:05,310 --> 00:08:06,720
-Director Xu.
-Take it easy.

133
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,720
I really have to thank you for today.

134
00:08:11,070 --> 00:08:12,270
-I'm so dizzy.
-Easy.

135
00:08:14,830 --> 00:08:16,090
-You know what?
-Easy.

136
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:19,080
One day, I'm going
to buy out Mr. Pei's company.

137
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:27,720
Director Xu, just call
a designated driver for me.

138
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,909
I'm not comfortable letting you go alone.

139
00:08:35,909 --> 00:08:38,200
Director Xu, I can get home by myself.

140
00:08:39,150 --> 00:08:41,020
My wife is waiting for me at home.

141
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:38,920
Wake up.

142
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:40,160
Come on, we're home.

143
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:42,290
Come on,

144
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:44,530
let me help you.

145
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:57,580
Let's go. I'll walk you upstairs.

146
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,550
No, no need.

147
00:09:59,630 --> 00:10:00,960
Thank you, Director Xu.

148
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,700
I can manage on my own.

149
00:10:05,810 --> 00:10:06,440
Easy now.

150
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:07,320
You can barely stand.

151
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:09,570
I'd feel better if I walked you upstairs.

152
00:10:09,570 --> 00:10:10,220
Come on.

153
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:11,430
No need.

154
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:12,280
Director Xu.

155
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,120
Easy.

156
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,820
Which one's your bedroom?

157
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:33,960
Careful.

158
00:11:42,090 --> 00:11:43,520
Do you need help

159
00:11:43,550 --> 00:11:45,390
getting undressed?
